(label "MOD_P7" (at 444.5 411.48 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "1b060cd4-fa11-5140-8f73-1e30b9deb8da"))
(text "POWER IN: J1 power only (D+/D- not fitted). Q1 cut (on by default), U2 ideal diode onto the XIAO's 5V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "86c0f052-046d-549c-b1e0-9b989b935222"))
(text "U2 ~CE tied to VOUT: the datasheet's ideal-diode mode (blocks current back into J1). The XIAO's 5V pin IS its USB-C VBUS (no part between," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6f1a4389-9427-5a88-8512-e8ddd3d1f1d5"))
(text "Seeed v1.2 schematic): a computer on the XIAO port and a charger on J1 share +5V. Firmware pulls PWR_CUT low once a computer has" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3923256e-64de-5c25-be62-db2d362a4702"))
(text "enumerated it (device mode): Q2 off, Q1 off, J1 cut. At reset PWR_CUT floats: R4/R5 hold Q2 on, so a charger alone always starts it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "856adeeb-675e-5418-9d67-adf36ae06561"))
(text "C4 (100 uF) not fitted: host-mode hot-plug reserve, against USB's 10 uF limit for a device." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5482e2a8-b789-57f7-9358-1895eeaba823"))
(text "XIAO ESP32S3 (Seeed footprint, 2 x 7 headers or castellations)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 238.76 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "05ff5199-485d-502f-b6ee-e4af8b1b760e"))
(text "D6 = GPIO43 has 499 ohm on the module (U0TXD). D2 = GPIO3 strapping, ignored by default eFuses. ENC_A = D6 = GPIO43, ENC_B = D7 = GPIO44 (U0TXD / U0RXD), IN_EN = D4 = GPIO5, MIDI_RX = D5 = GPIO6 (v5)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 238.76 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f3b3f017-f659-5dbf-9f59-87a85caa46a5"))
(text "v5: MIDI_TX1 = D0 = GPIO1 (OUT1 alone: Hi-Z in IN mode); MIDI_TXB = D1 = GPIO2 drives OUT2, OUT3 and OUT4 together (3 loops on one pad)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 238.76 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cb63207e-63b1-5f6d-8c23-3271b120b691"))
(text "LADDER = D2 = GPIO3 (ADC1): OK / BACK / PUSH on one resistor ladder. LED_DATA = D3 = GPIO4. SCL = D8 = GPIO7, SDA = D9 = GPIO8 (the OLED, I2C by the GPIO matrix). PWR_CUT = D10 = GPIO9, low = J1 cut." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 238.76 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "483e99d8-d86c-520d-965e-af5ddbb03add"))
(text "LED: one SK6812MINI-HS on +5V (top); U3 lifts the 3.3 V data to 5 V (VIH = 0.7 x VDD = 3.5 V at 5 V). SCREEN: J10, a 0.96 in 128 x 64 OLED (SSD1315, I2C 0x3C, 3V3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 129.54 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1a9773d9-fff9-573d-a071-fa1fe1674f4f"))
(text "MIDI OUT 1-4 (CA-033 at 3.3 V), v5: BOTH fitted on every output, the TRS (type A, top) AND the DIN-5 (bottom), in parallel; plug one at a time" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 200.66 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "37514229-8223-550d-939d-34d364a74e65"))
(text "TRS type A: tip = data (10 ohm to the TX pad), ring = source (33 ohm 0.5 W to 3V3), sleeve = GND.  DIN-5: pin 5 = tip net, pin 4 = ring net, pin 2 = GND, pins 1 and 3 open." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7c7aa168-d9ed-54d9-aede-4eeb174049e4"))
(text "OUT1: J2 TRS  and  J6 DIN" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "15b5ca5c-6f61-50c7-b431-5f61df224100"))
(text "OUT2: J3 TRS  and  J7 DIN" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 121.91999999999999 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a9a9c1fc-65d3-55b8-ad5c-024d497fae3a"))
(text "OUT3: J4 TRS  and  J8 DIN" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 218.44 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a615438b-60c4-5160-9fac-6ca65a9f7525"))
(text "OUT4: J5 TRS  and  J9 DIN" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 314.96 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6f916e75-e478-5114-ade3-718c3a87bc3d"))
(text "SW2..SW5: TRS type A / B per output (top side): they swap the jack's T and R between TIPk (data, sink) and RINGk (source) after the resistors; the DIN keeps pin 5 = TIPk, pin 4 = RINGk. 1-2 / 4-5 closed = type A." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 289.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ee90e695-7689-51a0-8d12-1dfd3dbba0e2"))
(text "OUT1 AS MIDI IN (software): TX1 to input (Hi-Z), IN_EN high (Q4 off: no source; Q3 on), MIDI_RX as UART RX" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0958d1dd-e812-50c5-8c8c-90af8ecc5dde"))
(text "OUT mode: IN_EN low (R53 at reset): Q4 on (3V3 to the 33 ohm), Q3 off, the opto's loop open (its body diode blocks), OUT1 drives as before. D2 across the opto's LED (reverse protection). OUT1 sits on the BACK edge (long board)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 309.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3cb36556-1296-5f7c-9b8f-aa579ecf68ca"))
(text "CONTROLS (top side, by the screen): one ADC ladder on GPIO3: R60 10k to 3V3; OK 2.2k, BACK 6.8k, PUSH 22k to GND" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140.0 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "85ed660b-a17e-57dd-929b-6bfa104e4b8f"))
(text "Idle 3.30 V, OK 0.60 V, BACK 1.34 V, PUSH 2.27 V (one switch at a time). Encoder A / B: 10k to 3V3, 100 nF to GND each." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140.0 309.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f83cc2a6-f8a3-5c91-85e8-09d207144c1e"))
(text "Each MIDI resistor (and R8): axial, hand-swappable; JP across it = bypass (0 ohm, open by default); R3k / R4k / R9 in parallel, not fitted (lower the value). JP2k bridged = RING on 3V3 directly (JP21: on SRC1): a mono plug then shorts the rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "99187617-dff2-5058-8261-2ab323304e64"))
(text "On the board each pair is ONE footprint (J6..J9, jank:MIDI_OUT_PJ-320A_top_DIN-504B-M10_bottom: the jack's pads T, R, S carry J2..J5's nets, its switch pin SW open; the DIN's pins on the bottom). J2..J5 are BOM lines only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cfe8bd18-1244-5bca-a708-76f96cb58aaf"))
(text "MODULAR: CLOCK / RESET out, 3.5 mm mono, left and right side walls: PCF8574T (I2C 0x20, A0..A2 low) P0 CLK_L, P1 RST_L, P5 CLK_R, P4 RST_R; P2 P3 P6 P7 spare on TP5..TP8" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 383.54 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af7ba0ce-32da-5687-8839-bba7185874e6"))
(text "Each: 74AHCT1G125 on +5V (TTL input: the expander's 3.3 V high is enough), 1 k in series, BAT54S from the jack's tip to GND and +5V; tip = signal, sleeve = GND, ring and switch open" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 388.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1b3836dc-b9de-526f-ae0c-0b89cfe6a25e"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
